// CAP_AEON_GENERIC_THREATS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2276573563" "Destined scum!"
// CAP_AEON_GENERIC_THREATS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2619188949" "You should have stayed in your cell, punk!"
// CAP_AEON_GENERIC_THREATS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2792639036" "You're not wanted here!"

// CAP_AEON_ALERTED :
"P1461688912" "Cripes!"
// CAP_AEON_ALERTED :
"P4233725591" "Oh, boy!"
// CAP_AEON_ALERTED :
"P1450195926" "Swarm! Swarm!"

// CAP_VICTIM_ATTACK :
"P2188992089" "No one is innocent!"
// CAP_VICTIM_ATTACK :
"P814681411" "You were next after these fools!"
// CAP_VICTIM_ATTACK :
"P3247504786" "Move along, citizen."
// CAP_VICTIM_ATTACK :
"P3368702541" "I was never really in danger.  But YOU are."

// CAP_GOLDBRICK_TAUNT :
"P965982668" "Whatcha going to do about it?"
// CAP_GOLDBRICK_TAUNT :
"P2314950559" "I don't see anyone around to help you."
// CAP_GOLDBRICK_TAUNT :
"P936322158" "Midas promised me a pound of chocolate for every 'rachnos helmet I turn in."
// CAP_GOLDBRICK_TAUNT :
"P2018872421" "You guys better have a good dental plan, 'cause I'm going to knock your teeth out"
// CAP_GOLDBRICK_TAUNT :
"P3380406247" "Face it, I don't like you, and you don't like me."
// CAP_GOLDBRICK_TAUNT :
"P2054943686" "You and your Arachnos friends have ruined this island."
// CAP_GOLDBRICK_TAUNT :
"P889566909" "Quit stalling and just take the beating."
// CAP_GOLDBRICK_TAUNT :
"P817874937" "This is for that beating I took last week."

// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2674606496" "Hurry up and cut through that wall."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1374887498" "Seems like we've been cutting all day."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3191481018" "Just how thick is this wall?"
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3550376113" "Keep at it and we'll get through."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2443913028" "Midas wants that stuff in there, badly."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4159126910" "Hope we get a better haul than last night."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P890745657" "When I was a kid in Paragon City, we only had hammers to break into things, so quit whining."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2627400516" "Hurry up.  I feel exposed up here."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2132778343" "Hope the spotters got this mark right. Don't want to waste Midas' time with junk."

// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P999826124" "Oh, man."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2134044499" "Get that fool."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2878428501" "With all of these interruptions, we'll never get done."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P401123490" "We have a quota to meet. Be quick about taking this fool out."
// AEON_GOLDBRICK_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3961611582" "Fresh Destined meat incoming!"

// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1593803964" "I'll be home by seven, I promise.  Unless I get pinched again."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1325754764" "Such a massive influx of new escapees from the Zig.  Recluse has really overstepped his bounds on this one."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P344403331" "Midas just told us to be here.  So here we are."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P614375441" "Just watching the Arachnos thugs walking around...Under orders to not get arrested today."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3217992362" "Midas gave us cell phones for whenever we get pinched. If we are quick about it, our lawyers can spring us before we even see the inside of a cell."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3730064758" "Can you have it here by eight?  The boys are getting hungry."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2047608971" "We're just supposed to hang out here and distract the Arachnos patrols. <em> ..No I'm pretty sure this is a secure line."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1884346987" "We watch them, they watch us.  It's a full life."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P867130197" "...Why yes, I'm very interested in changing my long distance carrier."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4007880244" "Reporting three 'Destined' scum dealt with today, sir!"
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1639681327" "My pack is acting up.  I'll need to get it fixed tomorrow."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3131199474" "Nothing to report, sir.  Nobody is hassling us."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1568007631" "Kill all 'Destined' scum.  Sounds good to me."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P889275714" "We will cleanse this island of those damnable new recruits Recluse imported."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3988200667" "Yeah, Midas has us boosting data and scientific records, day and night. Something big must be coming."

// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2867733849" "Gotta go."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P618796021" "Uh-oh."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P132908801" "Something's happening.  Gotta run."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3887835465" "I don't know who this fool is!  I'll jus' pound him."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P76993285" "Call my lawyer.  I'm about to get myself in trouble."
// CAP_AEON_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2971533338" "I'm going to have to put you on hold for a minute."

// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3726557066" "Try and keep up, boys."
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3982561561" "Watch for viable targets."
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2035706031" "Anyone else getting bugs in their teeth?"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3431655176" "Stay in formation!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3557800232" "Anyone else find that these packs get hot?"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P437861144" "Ease up on the throttle.  I think I see some 'Destined' meat to pound on."
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3901830180" "Stay high and pick your targets from above."
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1933363665" "I'm fond of the 'Death From Above' tactic.  Stay high, shoot low."
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2879700499" "Next guy who says they can see their house from here loses jetpack privileges."

// CAP_HAVEN_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2848065749" "If you get lost, use the orange PTS pipes as a navigation aid."
// CAP_HAVEN_SMALLPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1990841073" "Stick close to the pipes."

// CAP_HAVEN_SMALLPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P664843594" "Go! Go! Go!"
// CAP_HAVEN_SMALLPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3668557094" "Take 'em out!"
// CAP_HAVEN_SMALLPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P190081305" "'Destined Ones' dead ahead.  Deatroy them all!"
// CAP_HAVEN_SMALLPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P849674713" "Guns out! Kill this fool."
// CAP_HAVEN_SMALLPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P484152925" "I want this 'Destined One'."

// CAP_AEON_SMALLPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4006934532" "This is going to get worse before it gets better."

// CAP_AEON_SCAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2031281459" "We should really mark the open data nodes with chalk or something."
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2810509770" "Midas will pay top dollar for any unprotected data nodes."
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1101357887" "I think I see a weakness..."
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P371743337" "We find an open data node and we get paid."
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1994518050" "I think this scanner is busted."

// CAP_AEON_SCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1927345770" "I'm so tired of interruptions."
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P653062710" "Show 'em what for!"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P297138413" "Incoming!"

// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P748705871" "Find any holes in the firewall?"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P896782613" "That scanner working?"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P442770881" "I don't see what you are looking at."
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P320742304" "Hey, move your hand!"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P393452188" "Hey, got any of those chocolate bars left?"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P964876372" "One man's insecure wireless network is another man's payday."

// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3170618210" "Awww, not another interloper"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3945283067" "Get him!"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1658903377" "Right behind you!"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P109585429" "Drop that scanner and fight!"
// CAP_AEON_SCAN_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1559689407" "Hide the scanner.  The data is ours."

// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1495794177" "What are we looking for?"
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2603628168" "I know we are supposed to just hang out, but I'm tired of it."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2590555939" "Here, here, little Arachnos. Time for a surprise."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2412959523" "Let's not get too close. Okay, pal?"
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3886224772" "Watch that 'Destined' fool over there."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2949743944" "Project Destiny could mean the end of all that we know. Well... Our way of life, that is."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026813023" "I used to run with a gang in Paragon City.   It was okay. But here, I get a jetpack!"

// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P558206196" "Get 'em!"
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1291304335" "I'm on it."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2579935520" "We're on it."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P202042219" "Not again."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2761892941" "'Destined One', my foot."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3191941749" "Shoot 'em, boys!"

// CAP_GB_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3575335024" "Keep on walkin'."
// CAP_GB_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2471596563" "I see you...  Don't make me come down there."
// CAP_GB_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P567261925" "You got nothin' on us.  Just sitting here.  Minding our own business."
// CAP_GB_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P97250683" "I won't bother you if you don't bother me..."
// CAP_GB_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P746644270" "Midas said to find a good vantage point.  So here we are."
// CAP_GB_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1312946713" "Man, I hate it when people tell me to 'cool my jets.'"
// CAP_GB_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2850895829" "Stay alert for both Arachnos scum and those Destined fools."

// CAP_GB_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1157090125" "Tighten up the formation, boys!"

// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3834897639" "So I was talking to King Midas the other day...."
// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1192164732" "I never thought I'd get a job with a gang that hangs out at a candy factory."
// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3067112860" "Boy, I sure could go for a chocolate bar right about now."
// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P26162131" "I heard that Midas knows important people in the business world."
// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2315774237" "Midas really knows what he wants us to steal.  Computers, data, hard drives...  you know... things full of 'secrets.'"
// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3095059008" "I'm so sick of all these Project Destiny scum. We could end them all!"
// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3182561623" "Destined Ones, my foot. Midas has a plan to deal with these fools."
// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P537257756" "So we were beating on one of those new scum that Recluse broke out of the Zig awhile back... shhhhh."

// CAP_GB_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3486366154" "Heads up.  A 'Destined' fool is here."

// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1888992384" "And I win AGAIN!"
// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1542132529" "Score!  That's eleventy billion you owe me now!"
// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2966584615" "You ever get tired of losing?"
// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1288029014" "I LOVE this game!"
// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2414171507" "Statistically speaking, you are due to win SOMETIME."
// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4258300010" "Want to check the dice again? Would that make you feel better?"

// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1029007981" "Dang... and I was on a hot streak, too!"
// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2753214729" "The game'll have to wait."
// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2721207440" "Going to have to take your money after dealing with this fool."
// CAP_GB_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2744334270" "Quit loafing. We have scum to deal with."

// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P321883428" "I hate this game."
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1028830275" "You COULD be a bit more gracious about it."
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2344772340" "I hate dice."
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P194370701" "We should have played cards."
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4168541063" "Man!  Not again!"
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3164460055" "Argh!  Stupid dice!"
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2232328001" "You sure those ain't loaded??"
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3279701677" "This is the worst bad luck streak of all time!"
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1033919216" "If you're going to gloat, I'm not playing anymore."

// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2968065947" "Finally, a distraction."
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2467769784" "Maybe a little fightin' will change my luck."
// CAP_GB_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2645060623" "Dice ain't my game.  But fightin' is!"

// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P556768317" "Hard to see anything."
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2955926762" "I'm looking, I'm looking. Don't pressure me"
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1171926196" "I think there are some computers in there."
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P439428428" "This looks like a kids room, maybe we should move on..."
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1109090735" "Jackpot! Midas will want those computers in there."
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1231501811" "This will be a good haul.  Tell me when no one is looking and I'll cut the glass."
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4199555108" "Good stuff in there.  Call in some guys with cutting torches."
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1740704447" "Bingo. Office.  Lotsa computers in there."
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2790598122" "Better mark this place on the map.  We'll come back with some cutting torches."

// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1926547579" "We weren't doin' nothing!"
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2116103834" "That stuff in there is ours!"
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3704949184" "What makes you think I won't cut you?"
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P908528431" "Back off, it's ours!"
// CAP_GB_CASING_PEERIN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1941759771" "Not like you are the cops. Time to die."

// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2723582605" "See anything worth boosting?"
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P566754616" "Don't leave any fingerprints on the glass."
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1177269511" "If it looks good, we'll call in the cutters."
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P140181566" "Should we move on?"
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4159490247" "Maybe you should just smash the glass."
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P607714674" "Mark it down as a good place and we'll come back later."

// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3157645800" "This is our spot!"
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1762841740" "Midas will pay me a pound of chocolate for your ear!"
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2616756611" "Pounding time!"
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3100179530" "Here comes trouble."
// CAP_GB_CASING_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3117234345" "Destined scum. Let me show you your TRUE destiny."

// CAP_LONE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1286143858" "Keep a sharp eye out. Those Destined sum are always spoiling for a fight."
// CAP_LONE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1986764248" "Midas doesn't want any mistakes this time."
// CAP_LONE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1326446138" "Look, you're on patrol duty. Just patrol."

// CAP_LONE_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2188599052" "Well, what do we have here?"
// CAP_LONE_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3537364551" "Another 'Destined One' looking for trouble. Imagine my shock."
// CAP_LONE_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1536288956" "Come on. Let's take this joker down."

// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2990565003" "Alright, what's all the fuss about."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1464838816" "You look pretty guilty to me."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2591582106" "You, be quiet.  I ask the questions."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P488927519" "What were you doing up on that rooftop? Answer carefully."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P330793798" "So you thought you'd pound on a few of those fools from Project Destiny."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P709642295" "We have laws, you know.  You can't just attack anyone you disagree with. Without my permission, that is."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3131749715" "Paperwork be damned, I should just toss you into a cell for the night."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1514342604" "Turn of those damnable packs of yours.  I don't want you flying away."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3452122792" "Fred over there tells me you have some cutting torches on you.  Never seen 'em before, right?"
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P408228979" "Now, Now, don't go pollutin' your britches in terror.  We just have some questions."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P800625737" "Lotta crimes 'round here lately.  Let me guess... you were never here."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1399038451" "Heard you lot been jumping the new recruits from the Zig.  Can't say that I disapprove."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2824528333" "Quit eyeballing me, and keep those hands up."

// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2108289073" "We'll get back to the talkin' after this."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3197513593" "Don't leave town."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3794941634" "This is your lucky day, punk."
// CAP_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4104484059" "Beat it scum.  This bounty is mine!"

